          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Surface cleaner streaks are almost always fixable, and the pattern points to the cause. Straight bands mean more overlap. Swirls mean slow down or get more flow to the bar. A haze means rinse. Fix one thing at a time and judge the result dry.
          </p>
